# Inline assembly checked with Isla (verus/ISLA.md) up to the exception
# the system call takes (aarch64 `svc`) or the kernel's entry point
# (x86_64 `syscall`), so the kernel's side of the call stays unchecked:
# run.sh checks each against the contract verus/isla/seams.md quotes.
# `#1` is the x86_64 `mod imp`, `#2` the aarch64 one.
